# Nelle - "Talk" interaction.

if not flag("met_nelle")
	do set_flag("met_nelle")
	Nelle: Hi! I'm Nelle. Nice to finally meet you.
	=> END

Nelle: Oh, hi {player.display_name}!
- Want to grab lunch later?
	if girl.affection >= 3
		Nelle: I'd love to!
		do add_stat("affection", 1)
	else
		Nelle: Maybe some other time...
- Keep up the good work.
	Nelle: Thanks, I'm trying my best.
Nelle: Talk to you later!
